          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP569 - Lethbridge Costco - a grey day to be capping in Lethbridge, lots of lovely places and a little rain. Thanks OFTH for maintaining the brass cap cache.&lt;/p&gt;

