          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP569 Lethbridge Costco&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N49° 39.703 W112° 47.813 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We needed the shovel for this one. The Costco was crazy busy. Nice location ..thks OFTH&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cap # 18 today.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681184658">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-24T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP569 - Lethbridge Costco

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt;  N49° 39.702' W112° 47.815'

&lt;strong&gt;My GPSr:&lt;/strong&gt;  N49° 39.701' W112° 47.814'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We parked very close to this one as the madness that is a Costco parking lot played itself out around us. The cap was covered up and I thought we'd need the shovel, but not really: at my first attempt to dig some dirt out I hit the cap which only had a bit of dirt covering it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="680228870">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-22T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="4853503">gumbyphv</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;I found BCP569 Lethbridge Costco.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My mom has a bowling tournament in Lethbridge this weekend.  Last weekend my dad realized that he wasn't going to be able to come down so my mom asked me if I would.  Of course I would come down and cheer them on and grab a few caches.  A couple of nights ago I looked to see how many caps I still had to find in town here.  I have 14 to find so my mission this weekend was to find all 14 caps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We got to the hotel and she called one of her teammates to meet for supper.  It turned out that I had a little under an hour before we were going for supper so it was time to start my cap hunting.  i started with this cap and marker post has a nice big hole beside it.  After removing some dirt with my trowel I was able to see the cap.  Thanks for another nice cap.  TFTBC  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
      </groundspeak:logs>
